  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Country profiles: The rights and wellbeing of older persons in Kuwait and Algeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Produce 2 infographic-style country cards (aka ageing profiles), one per country, that present the latest information on:  

core demographic, health, and socio-economic indicators on older adults, 

ageing-relevant policy context, and  

limited commentary on presented information. We will add a comment reflecting on availability, timeliness and granularity of collated data, and will only provide a top-line commentary on indicators and relevant policy1 
 

ESCWA estimates that the majority of Arab countries are expected to complete the ageing transition over the next 13 to 40 years.2</narrative>
  </description>
